{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "621abce51aef66a788b9a0be1cc0568f33b0620765f80564da615bd46f7e0765", "ja": "フィナーレは、ご自慢のメニューと共に♪", "zh": "带着自豪的料理一同迎接尾声♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0c15b56ea2140261a340b97224ac18758e0045c3ac137b60ab83649e4a40b690", "ja": "『三姉妹カフェ』は無事クランクアップ。\r\n監督や撮影スタッフ達へのお礼に、それぞれ\r\nの得意メニューを振る舞う三姉妹。楽しそう\r\nなみんなの様子を眺めながら、映画の公開を\r\n待ち遠しく思うプロデューサーであった。", "zh": "《三姊妹咖啡厅》顺利杀青了。\n三姊妹各自做了拿手料理，\n感谢导演以及剧组人员的付出。\n制作人看着大家欢乐的样子，\n开始等不及想看电影上映了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "597bfa8267e5bbf8cc113214c6056dd1b406abbb0fa043f671f0ede1307a0502", "ja": "（『三姉妹カフェ』は、無事クランクアップを迎えた！\nみんな、本当によくやったな……）", "zh": "（《三姊妹咖啡厅》终于顺利杀青了！\n大家真的表现得很棒……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1001_kantoku", "source_sha256": "2eb2f28b4b38a1532dbea02696a08efc40f7a81ce5258017e5e5833a83bbbd9b", "ja": "お疲れさまでした！　皆さんのおかげで、\n私のイメージ通りの映画を撮る事ができました！", "zh": "辛苦了！托各位的福，\n成功拍出我脑海中的电影了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "09c8f3258cf2deeff9783d0eb23cc972a6a62ee11273fbfe07bc0a7bf80c7ec5", "ja": "お疲れさま～！　監督もスタッフの人たちも\nみんなあったかくて、いい現場だったわ。", "zh": "辛苦了～！导演跟工作人员都很热情，\n真是不错的拍片现场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "1811318b65a673280b5a5554b211373ae56beb01c11bef62ad3493c34feb6a0c", "ja": "そうですね。この映画の撮影で、\nいろいろなことを勉強させてもらいました。", "zh": "对呀，这次参与电影的拍摄，\n真的让我学到好多东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "1965d70d95cf271d1a25bebc0da816448d4e8d452befc11099b77ff10a9af0f8", "ja": "それで……私たちで、お世話になった\nスタッフのみなさんに、お礼を用意したんです。", "zh": "所以……我们几个准备了礼物，\n想谢谢照顾我们的各位工作人员。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1005_052kao", "source_sha256": "4263acb096c976c9b0c6471ba5b68e810e47f74dd6a246352ec37784948dcc27", "ja": "空猫珈琲店の名物メニュー……\nよかったら、召し上がっていただけませんか？", "zh": "空猫咖啡厅的招牌料理……\n各位愿意吃吃看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1006_kantoku", "source_sha256": "a222798bd387c6d82c7942150153672180b961d10138f8accc4e2e09ab9d9cb1", "ja": "えっ……いいんですか！？\n監督冥利に尽きます！", "zh": "咦……可以吗！？\n我这个导演太有福气了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "9f781adc7e2f995670b18e92b8d6c9c0583815c1bb648364c516e5800d871aa5", "ja": "三奈の、シフォンケーキ……。\n気にいってもらえると……嬉しい……な……♪", "zh": "三奈的，戚风蛋糕……\n希望大家会……喜……欢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "8fe6e37a0e45982576c228600b54e3eadb25f732a6b5c0d4e357123cc8faf721", "ja": "どのメニューも、とてもおいしいですよ～。\n食べると、幸せな気持ちになります～♪", "zh": "每一道都非常好吃喔～\n吃下去会感受到满满的幸福～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1009_052kao", "source_sha256": "f29cd884aceabd6c59c6f1ca3bf53b753466fb705fe95807d68c03f888f0a900", "ja": "コーヒー、おかわりが欲しい人がいたら、\n遠慮なくどうぞ♪", "zh": "如果还有人想再续咖啡，\n请尽管说，不用客气喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "bc7677030281bee185f68761e71a03c3a035dc76c788edf497713f882bcf423b", "ja": "歌織さん……\n杏奈にも、おかわり、お願いします……♪", "zh": "歌织姊……\n杏奈也，想要，再喝一杯……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "e8a91e56da7ec26ad8130a1e104ef7d18390a218076981375d64dd192dc45353", "ja": "歌織さんのコーヒーって、\nオムライスと、よく合いますよね。", "zh": "歌织姊泡的咖啡，\n真的跟蛋包饭非常对味呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1012_052kao", "source_sha256": "8f7d67163f42d97b92a818449dbf771a2d65c5cd03b8d17ee3dacbea8a64d978", "ja": "ふふ、よかった！　撮影が始まるまでの間に、\nいろいろなコーヒー豆を試してみたの。", "zh": "呵呵，太好了！在正式开拍以前，\n我试了很多种不同的咖啡豆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1013_052kao", "source_sha256": "56764553c124f6930648277e3afe29b7ecf00028c94e7b23ef6273afa6e4f4eb", "ja": "きっと一夏なら、オムライスやシフォンケーキに\nよく合うコーヒーを淹れるだろうと思って。", "zh": "我想如果是一夏，她泡的咖啡肯定会\n很适合搭蛋包饭或戚风蛋糕一起享用。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "9260eff01a973e0eafe4fc9bc26bce7c80248f33d6b57121aac05d1f1bdf74c8", "ja": "そこまで考えてたなんて……。\n歌織さん、やっぱりすごいな……。", "zh": "居然设想得这么周到……\n歌织姊真的好让人佩服……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "5cbde7ec2b88120ad2245cba7a328add63f058ec81a5fd8857a645409bc99a59", "ja": "うん……すごい……。なんでもできて……\n歌織さん、本物のお姉さんみたい……。", "zh": "嗯……好厉害……什么都做得来……\n歌织姊就像真的姊姊一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1016_052kao", "source_sha256": "9d8725d7ff64301e0c793e38705a5d9cc1f24320c64fbeebca92e3442b462ddd", "ja": "まぁ……ふふっ。私も、ふたりが妹みたいで\n楽しかったわ。これからも仲良くしてね！", "zh": "好说好说……呵呵，我也很开心自己像是有了\n两个妹妹一样，以后也要好好相处喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "059c5ca157b74d3dc1381c3605e2d380c6963c4411791c40a7cba5647fa45b3e", "ja": "はい……♪", "zh": "好的……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "8f2aa13312864d4059cb82adff3b10055e719c2bdb4d3d7b3a2b09e2ecd71ff8", "ja": "それにしても、どれもおいしいわ～。こんな\nお店が近くにあったら、毎日でも通うんだけどなー。", "zh": "话说回来，每一道都好好吃喔～\n如果附近有这种店，那我肯定天天报到～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ab6fadeadeab1f5be41a1d91287229bd600770952e40ca7bb8f40201ae47da1a", "ja": "そうだな。劇場の近くにあるといいんだけど……。", "zh": "对啊，真希望剧场附近有这种店……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "939da5a5484394d70cf1b03b582aa52d2f6136c019bffcaca71bd8bc70b6b3bc", "ja": "ちょっと、{$P$}くん？\nその割に、さっきからコーヒーばっかりじゃない？", "zh": "喂，我说{$P$}啊，\n你嘴上这样讲，却一直只喝咖啡耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1022_046rio", "source_sha256": "74a8661790fa401033dbb41036bc60ad9d111c9d5ad3faf532d036d1eccb5d36", "ja": "オムライスとシフォンケーキは食べないの？\nこんなにおいしいのに……。", "zh": "你不吃蛋包饭跟戚风蛋糕吗？\n这么好吃耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1023_p", "source_sha256": "63cd5cb08c49ff891cc5b0399ebd4e1dcbad7eb313a6f56f58da3c6bdb6635c5", "ja": "いや……俺はもう、たくさん食べたというか……。", "zh": "呃不……我已经吃得够多了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1024_046rio", "source_sha256": "31a50aca4dc15827b6e165945be301d1435ea32f59bb2af0a27428d66eb2de92", "ja": "あ、体重気にしてるの？　大丈夫、大丈夫！\nあとで私が、いいダイエット方法教えてあげるから！", "zh": "啊，你是在担心体重？别怕、别怕！\n我等等会教你不错的瘦身招数啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "d5b60e20a20bce41a8a475c4f75ccc809a47487bd6d1b9f3caf0776bdcc29e0e", "ja": "そ、そうか……それじゃあせっかくだし、\nいただこうかな。", "zh": "这、这样啊……那，难得有这个机会，\n我就吃一点吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "55f75608c269b493028e1d9516f8a71597ca7b1ba92e7f794b0fc96c3091c7ba", "ja": "当然です。そのために、がんばったんですから。\n……ちゃんと、食べてもらわないと。", "zh": "这还用说，我就是为了这个才努力学的。\n……你当然要多吃一点才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1027_024ann", "source_sha256": "799adccfd5e2d6130f803888da1c184fe24d8c4902bd63e778e747524d57256e", "ja": "杏奈も……心、こめました……♪\nありがとうって……伝わると、いいな……♪", "zh": "杏奈也……用心，做了很多……♪\n希望对大家的感谢……有传达出去……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1028_p", "source_sha256": "eda69cbd89a0d66d77909a71252698650f79abaa143d65989220d3f5150e556e", "ja": "うん、わかってたけど、うまい！\nスタッフのみなさんも、どんどん食べてくださいね！", "zh": "嗯，虽然早就知道了，但真的很好吃！\n各位工作人员也千万别客气喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1029_p", "source_sha256": "749e2c43fdcdb46cd97f15d5d0dffb7d2aee56ad1d046da3c918c1d8eae66bf5", "ja": "（みんな美味しそうに、空猫珈琲店の\nメニューを食べてくれている）", "zh": "（空猫咖啡厅的料理\n让大家吃得津津有味。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1030_p", "source_sha256": "117a0ece6a48c52505989f9df0a9e2480cd7ab967f72c5ab3478dd9881113e55", "ja": "（ささやかなお礼だけど……\nみんなと用意して、よかったな）", "zh": "（虽然只是一点心意……\n但幸好有跟大家一起准备。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1031_042miy", "source_sha256": "e0a711f8e256df2ec8862f8b7bf4f168a51db3682b9f2705d6e9da5de7f16361", "ja": "みなさん、ごちそうさまでした～。\nとってもおいしかったですよ～。", "zh": "谢谢你们的招待～\n真的非常好吃喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1032_024ann", "source_sha256": "18dd66253a5fa6c76d4826201b3fd40b6242e0c9c2967c222d26397cee89a19d", "ja": "ありがとね、ミャオ……じゃなかった……。\n美也さん……。", "zh": "谢谢你，喵尾……不对……\n是美也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_07_1033_042miy", "source_sha256": "4e6c365a501970c53f95bf8f8a9ee2625a592ef2bd84e729cca1e5c8d0b186d9", "ja": "ふふ～。\nミャオでいいんですよ、三奈ちゃん～。ミャ～♪", "zh": "呵呵～\n叫喵尾就好了，三奈～喵～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
